              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima omugabe Daudi yaagambira omutwe gwona ogwabaire guteeraine ati: Mutabani wangye Sulemaani, ou Ruhanga atooraine wenka, akiri muto, takahamire, kandi omurimo ni muhango; ahabw'okuba enju teriba nju y'abantu, kureka eryaba eya MUKAMA Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo ntegwire enju ya Ruhanga wangye, nk'oku ndikubaasa, naatunga ezaabu ahabw'ebintu by'ezaabu, efeeza ahabw'ebintu by'efeeza, emiringa ahabw'ebintu by'emiringa, ebyoma ahabw'ebintu by'ebyoma, n'ebiti ahabw'ebintu by'ebiti, otabariireho mabaare amaingi agarikwetwa shohamu, n'agandi mabaare maingi g'okuhunda, n'amabaare garikwengyengyeta ag'amabara maingi n'ag'obuguzi bwingi ag'emiringo yoona, n'agarikwetwa marimaari agatarikubarwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ahabw'okukunda oku nyine aha nju ya Ruhanga wangye, nk'oku nyine obutungi bwangye ahabwangye obw'ezaabu n'efeeza, mbwenu naabuhayo ahabw'enju ya Ruhanga wangye, okwongyera ahari ebyo byona ebi naateekateekyeire egyo nju erikwera; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 9:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.22.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 22:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " n'etalanta z'ezaabu za Ofiri enkumi ishatu, ez'efeeza eshemeziibwe enkumi mushanju ez'okushweka ebisiika by'enju, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ezaabu ahabw'ebintu by'ezaabu, n'efeeza ahabw'ebintu by'efeeza, ebirikukorwa abanyamyoga b'obwengye. Mbwenu eri izooba n'oha orikwikiriza kugira eki yaahayo, naayeyereza MUKAMA?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
