        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba omu maisho gaawe turi abagyenyi n'abashuhuuki, nka baatatenkuriitwe boona oku baabaire bari; ebiro ebi tumara aha nsi ni nk'ekicuucu, tihariho matsiko g'okumereera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, ebintu ebi byona ebingi, ebi tuteekateekire kukwombekyera enju ahabw'eiziina ryawe eririkwera, birugire omu mukono gwawe, kandi byona n'ebyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
