          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, owa Isaaka, kandi n'owa Israeli baatatenkuriitwe, ebi obihamye omu biteekateeko by'omu mitima y'abantu baawe; otebeekanise emitima yaabo, ebe niiwe yaazaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
