            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Daudi yaagambira omutwe gwona ati: Musiime MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. Batyo abantu boona abaabaire bateeraine baasiima MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo, bainika emitwe yaabo, baaramya MUKAMA, kandi baatangirira omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
