              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " eryo izooba baarya, baanywa bashemereirwe, bari omu maisho ga MUKAMA. Baagaruka baayemeka Sulemaani mwene Daudi omugabe obwa kabiri, baamushukaho amajuta g'okumushoroorera MUKAMA kuba omugabe, na Zadoki kuba omunyamurwa.",
