          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo Daudi mwene Yese yaategyekire Israeli yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyaka ei yaamazire naategyeka Israeli ekahika makumi ana; emyaka mushanju akagimara Heburooni, kandi emyaka makumi ashatu n'eshatu yaagimara Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima yaafa, yaahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru, amazire ebiro bingi ari omutungi munonga, kandi aine ekitiinisa kingi; omutabani Sulemaani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi omugabe Daudi yaakozire byona, okwiha aha by'okubanza okuhitsya aha by'aha muheru, bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyabaireho ekya Samueli omuhanuuzi, n'ekya Nasani nabi, kandi n'ekya Gaadi omuhanuuzi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hamwe n'eby'obutegyeki bwe bwona, n'eby'amaani ge, n'ebyamubaireho, n'ahari Israeli kandi n'aha bugabe bwona obw'ezo nsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
